{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"57915","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57915","key":"SV-11421","fields":{"summary":"Board View – Browser Back Loses the Board's Sideways and Column Position","parent":{"id":"56388","key":"SV-10044","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/56388","fields":{"summary":"Switch between display options","status":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/status/10350","description":"","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/","name":"Ready for QA","id":"10350","statusCategory":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/statuscategory/4","id":4,"key":"indeterminate","colorName":"yellow","name":"In Progress"}},"priority":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/priority/3","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/images/icons/priorities/medium_new.svg","name":"Medium","id":"3"},"issuetype":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issuetype/10245","id":"10245","description":"Stories track functionality or features expressed as user goals.","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10315?size=medium","name":"Story","subtask":false,"avatarId":10315,"entityId":"2d932db9-30a4-451f-aa74-561885726568","hierarchyLevel":0}}},"attachment":[{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/attachment/62423","id":"62423","filename":"C96916-1-board-before-open.png","author":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3A6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e","accountId":"712020:6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e","emailAddress":"bilal.muzamil@shopview.com","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png"},"displayName":"Bilal Muzamil","active":true,"timeZone":"Asia/Karachi","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"2026-10-16T05:43:50.440-0500","size":133102,"mimeType":"image/png","content":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/attachment/content/62423","thumbnail":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/attachment/thumbnail/62423"},{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/attachment/62424","id":"62424","filename":"C96916-2-board-after-back.png","author":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3A6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e","accountId":"712020:6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e","emailAddress":"bilal.muzamil@shopview.com","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/939e0aa31ab923104bfaac4c5012d8c0?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBM-2.png"},"displayName":"Bilal Muzamil","active":true,"timeZone":"Asia/Karachi","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"2026-10-16T05:43:51.389-0500","size":112924,"mimeType":"image/png","content":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/attachment/content/62424","thumbnail":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/attachment/thumbnail/62424"}],"description":"h2. Description\n\n*After opening a work order from Board View and pressing the browser's Back button, the board should come back where it was:* the same sideways position exactly, and the card that was at the top of the column back at the top. On staging the board comes back at the far left, and the tab under the page title has changed from *All* to *Work Orders*.\n\nFor example,\n\n* the board was scrolled right to a technician near the end of the board, and down that technician's column\n* after Back, the first columns (Unassigned, Aaron Baker …) are in view and that technician's column is out of view\n* the tab has changed from *All* to *Work Orders*\n\nh2. Steps to Reproduce\n\n# Sign in to staging as an Admin and check the top bar shows *Staging Heavy Duty - 9919*.\n# Open *Work Orders*, click the *All* tab, type {{ZZAUTOTEST F1 Scroll Back Theresa}} in *Search* and click *Board View*.\n# Scroll the board to the right until *Theresa Webb*'s column is fully in view, then scroll down inside her column a few cards.\n# Click a card that is in view to open its work order.\n# Press the browser's *Back* button.\n#* The *Work Orders* tab is chosen instead of *All*.\n#* The board is at the far left; Theresa Webb's column is not in view.\n\n*Actual Result:*\n\n* The board's sideways position and the column's scroll position are lost, and the tab changes to Work Orders.\n\n*Expected Result:*\n\n* The same columns are in view at exactly the same sideways position, and the card that was at the top of Theresa Webb's column comes back at the top, fully shown (it may sit up to one card from the exact position).\n\nh2. Screenshots\n\n!C96916-1-board-before-open.png|width=1962,height=1084!\n\n!C96916-2-board-after-back.png|width=1962,height=1084!\n\nh2. Environment\n\n* *Build:* {{v26.40.18-7d85b7d}} on [staging|https://app.staging.shopview.com/workorders] · *Location:* Staging Heavy Duty - 9919 · *User:* Admin, example card {{S2-36407}} at the top of Theresa Webb's column · seen 16 Oct 2026\n\nh2. Sources\n\n* [PRD – Work Orders — Board View & Tech View Display Options|https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=845185030] (Confluence page 845185030, version 58, read 16 Oct 2026), S1-R8:\nIn Tech View and Board View, browser Back restores both vertical and horizontal scroll position. Horizontal position comes back exactly. Vertically, the row or card that was at the top of the view comes back at the top, fully shown; it may sit up to one row or card from the exact pixel position. List behaves as it does today.\n* Related, not the same problem: [SV-11407] (a half-visible top card or row comes back hidden). Here the whole sideways and column position is lost. Only Board View was checked for this ticket.\n\nh2. Test case\n\n* [C96916 Browser Back restores the scroll position in Tech View and Board View|https://shopview.testrail.io/index.php?/cases/view/96916]","issuelinks":[{"id":"33600","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issueLink/33600","type":{"id":"10003","name":"Relates","inward":"relates to","outward":"relates to","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issueLinkType/10003"},"outwardIssue":{"id":"56388","key":"SV-10044","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/56388","fields":{"summary":"Switch between display options","status":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/status/10350","description":"","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/","name":"Ready for QA","id":"10350","statusCategory":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/statuscategory/4","id":4,"key":"indeterminate","colorName":"yellow","name":"In Progress"}},"priority":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/priority/3","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/images/icons/priorities/medium_new.svg","name":"Medium","id":"3"},"issuetype":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issuetype/10245","id":"10245","description":"Stories track functionality or features expressed as user goals.","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10315?size=medium","name":"Story","subtask":false,"avatarId":10315,"entityId":"2d932db9-30a4-451f-aa74-561885726568","hierarchyLevel":0}}}},{"id":"33605","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issueLink/33605","type":{"id":"10003","name":"Relates","inward":"relates to","outward":"relates to","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issueLinkType/10003"},"outwardIssue":{"id":"57901","key":"SV-11407","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57901","fields":{"summary":"Tech View and Board View: Back brings the top row or card back fully shown","status":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/status/10283","description":"","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/","name":"TESTING STAGE","id":"10283","statusCategory":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/statuscategory/4","id":4,"key":"indeterminate","colorName":"yellow","name":"In Progress"}},"priority":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/priority/3","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/images/icons/priorities/medium_new.svg","name":"Medium","id":"3"},"issuetype":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issuetype/10008","id":"10008","description":"Bugs track problems or errors. (Migrated on 31 Dec 2023 09:01 UTC)","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium","name":"Bug","subtask":false,"avatarId":10303,"entityId":"28af1af2-ae8b-4de4-94eb-bcecd7d4031c","hierarchyLevel":0}}}},{"id":"33609","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issueLink/33609","type":{"id":"10003","name":"Relates","inward":"relates to","outward":"relates to","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issueLinkType/10003"},"inwardIssue":{"id":"57934","key":"SV-11440","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57934","fields":{"summary":"Work Orders List: browser Back can return on a different tab than the one on screen","status":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/status/10349","description":"","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/","name":"Open","id":"10349","statusCategory":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/statuscategory/2","id":2,"key":"new","colorName":"blue-gray","name":"To Do"}},"priority":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/priority/3","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/images/icons/priorities/medium_new.svg","name":"Medium","id":"3"},"issuetype":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issuetype/10008","id":"10008","description":"Bugs track problems or errors. (Migrated on 31 Dec 2023 09:01 UTC)","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium","name":"Bug","subtask":false,"avatarId":10303,"entityId":"28af1af2-ae8b-4de4-94eb-bcecd7d4031c","hierarchyLevel":0}}}}],"comment":{"comments":[{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57915/comment/78873","id":"78873","author":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3Aaa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","accountId":"712020:aa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png"},"displayName":"Chris Ward","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Bogota","accountType":"atlassian"},"body":"[~accountid:712020:1b27a800-7b5a-43f3-982a-81e7071a4fdb] valid. The root cause looks like Back returning on the Work Orders tab instead of All, so the saved position never restores. Please also check whether List loses the tab on Back today; either way Board and Tech View must restore per S1-R8. Related to SV-11407 (top card fully shown). [~accountid:712020:b2d16ade-9013-4875-8a9d-e255e63e8217] [~accountid:712020:6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e] for QA: test against [PRD v60|https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=845185030] S1-R8.","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3Aaa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","accountId":"712020:aa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png"},"displayName":"Chris Ward","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Bogota","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"2026-10-16T09:23:15.471-0500","updated":"2026-10-16T09:23:15.471-0500","jsdPublic":true},{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57915/comment/78887","id":"78887","author":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3A1b27a800-7b5a-43f3-982a-81e7071a4fdb","accountId":"712020:1b27a800-7b5a-43f3-982a-81e7071a4fdb","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/32366c118499b215991a54cfdb2cb1c4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSM-1.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/32366c118499b215991a54cfdb2cb1c4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSM-1.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/32366c118499b215991a54cfdb2cb1c4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSM-1.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/32366c118499b215991a54cfdb2cb1c4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSM-1.png"},"displayName":"Slavcho Mitrov","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Bogota","accountType":"atlassian"},"body":"[~accountid:712020:aa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20] your read is right. Back takes the tab from the saved preference rather than what was on screen, and the refresh after Back can switch it too. Board and Tech View will restore the tab, filters and position. The List loses the tab the same way, since it shares the view state, and production's List likely does too, less often. Should we fix the List in this release, or leave it as today?","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3A1b27a800-7b5a-43f3-982a-81e7071a4fdb","accountId":"712020:1b27a800-7b5a-43f3-982a-81e7071a4fdb","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/32366c118499b215991a54cfdb2cb1c4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSM-1.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/32366c118499b215991a54cfdb2cb1c4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSM-1.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/32366c118499b215991a54cfdb2cb1c4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSM-1.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/32366c118499b215991a54cfdb2cb1c4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSM-1.png"},"displayName":"Slavcho Mitrov","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Bogota","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"2026-10-16T10:01:55.849-0500","updated":"2026-10-16T10:01:55.849-0500","jsdPublic":true},{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57915/comment/78895","id":"78895","author":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3Aaa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","accountId":"712020:aa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png"},"displayName":"Chris Ward","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Bogota","accountType":"atlassian"},"body":"[~accountid:712020:1b27a800-7b5a-43f3-982a-81e7071a4fdb] leave the List as it is today in this release; Board and Tech View restore the tab, filters and position (S1-R8). The List is now its own bug, SV-11440. Please make sure the Board/Tech fix doesn't change List behavior. See [PRD v61|https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=845185030].","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3Aaa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","accountId":"712020:aa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png"},"displayName":"Chris Ward","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Bogota","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"2026-10-16T10:17:13.732-0500","updated":"2026-10-16T10:17:13.732-0500","jsdPublic":true}],"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57915/comment","maxResults":3,"total":3,"startAt":0},"status":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/status/10283","description":"","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/","name":"TESTING STAGE","id":"10283","statusCategory":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/statuscategory/4","id":4,"key":"indeterminate","colorName":"yellow","name":"In Progress"}}}}